      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Knee pain as the leading symptom can show the way to the diagnosis. Transmission and character of pain indicates the different diagnosis. The theories of pain formation are shown and explain. The information given by the patient should not be the only reason for an active therapy. Also there should be some objective clinical statements in order to permit active therapy. The article shows the combination between pain and objective statements."},
